{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "006c7d448df3f0a2fb9f90a1cf1d60083b3457534b75d89aae7fc44ccc65aed6", "ja": "えっと……こうかな？　そんでもって……。\nゴー、ファイ、ウィン！　ゴー、ファイッ……。", "zh": "那个……是这样吗？　然后……。\nGo、Fi、Win！　Go、Fi……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1001_p", "source_sha256": "87ca08545563364519b7d09b3dc678de2aa5e64750487714761cd22161c188aa", "ja": "……昴？　お疲れさま。何してるんだ？", "zh": "……昴？辛苦了。你在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "881b4794068c63025c116b7a39cbc718cc73fe07372cd90675020eb8e9304078", "ja": "うわっ、{$P$}！？\nい、いつからそこにいたんだよ？", "zh": "哇啊，{$P$}！？\n你、你什么时候在那里的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2857e01a96285375dd97364fa43a329fa81b270df6ece86a65c2ffb000c0e418", "ja": "ちょっと前かな。\nなんか熱心にやってたから、声かけづらくて……。", "zh": "大概就在刚才吧。\n看你做得那么认真，我都有点不好意思出声了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "62a4bf87b94dabf0b9853b9b4b159a861f754f310d4d01625abb8931c40d3a8b", "ja": "いるならいるって言ってくれよ～！\nおかげで、ハズいとこ見られちゃったじゃんか……。", "zh": "在的话就跟我说一声嘛～！\n害我都把丢人的一面给你看光了啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1005_p", "source_sha256": "380241354455edeedad1c996eae45c3e6165714d29467d6685af5b4523f61a56", "ja": "ゴメンゴメン。で、何してたんだ？", "zh": "抱歉抱歉。对了，你刚才在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "f3292a5b3d09b4598b8d8adebb22632e06492236a9149b2028feff7a436e96be", "ja": "なにって……チアだよ、チア！\nこの衣装、チアガールなんだろ？", "zh": "你问我在干什么……当然是啦啦队啊，啦啦队！\n这身衣服，不就是啦啦队服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "ef3a60d8a478acd07c3b853e6ea9fb59d23279fcfec022de15270f8f85817b63", "ja": "だから、チアのパフォーマンスを観たりして、\n練習してみてるんだ。形から入ろうと思ってさ。", "zh": "所以我会看看啦啦队的表演，试着练习一下。我想先从形式上入手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1008_p", "source_sha256": "41f4d670e5f1cbfca6a96d18c41ebaaa9ee350242df5080cdc11744a7028d02a", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことか。\nうん、結構サマになってたと思うけど。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么回事啊。\n嗯，我觉得你做得还挺像模像样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "9463e379f59495b58c2339d5000568f78b6b9495b4f477c413ba87954d349adb", "ja": "え、そう？　オレ、しっくりきてないんだけど……。\nなんか応援してる感じ、しなくない？", "zh": "诶，是吗？我觉得自己还没找到感觉……\n总觉得不像是在给谁加油，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8e7f3cc83371aff39f13a98cc8c82787a5557a0728e809f67427823b3fc37f7d", "ja": "そうなのか？　じゃあ……\n昴、誰か応援したい相手はいないか？", "zh": "是这样吗？那就……\n\n昴，你有没有想为谁加油的对象？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1011_p", "source_sha256": "61507c60a7e051747529c0e4522f9ae3f1f7520f0446624c914f9ada5f302726", "ja": "応援って、相手がいる事だからな。\n漠然とやるより、しっかり気持ちが入ると思うよ。", "zh": "毕竟给别人加油，是需要有对象的。\n比起漫无目的地加油，我觉得这样更能倾注心意哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "c88af41a427b0e7cedb8ee1203f471dfe01a27bcf2b2daa62c2454f4b4e71819", "ja": "なるほどな～！　オレが応援したい相手か……\n劇場の誰かとか？　でもなぁ、うーん……あっ！", "zh": "原来如此～！我想为之加油的对象啊……  \n比如剧场里的谁？不过嘛，嗯……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "5f2dd79c992b2fc196d75ef5fe0b8381af24c8565af4bd4e7ec8f2ee87c36dda", "ja": "{$P$}。\nオレ、応援したいヤツいるかも……！", "zh": "{$P$}。\n我好像有想为之加油的人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e9a5e0588de5c5fb3c0ddc06864a6b3ca9619d21bb0b7ec4849c375f33e0816a", "ja": "おっ、誰だ？", "zh": "哦，是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "1e6b04cebb0e19974d482cbb200fbbe2f70b01ee1429fed3119d9a32c750f391", "ja": "えっと……そいつ、アイドルが好きでさ。\nでも、自分がなれるなんてちっとも思ってなくて……。", "zh": "那个……那家伙很喜欢偶像。\n但是，从没想过自己也能成为偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "f86c2af72c19bdda108c2d5a17e7446ab2393f63a6b0c8dbf7c63a11623fde9f", "ja": "カワイイ衣装とか、ステージで歌ったり\n踊ったりするのも、ハズい！って思ってるんだけど。", "zh": "虽然觉得可爱的服装，还有在舞台上唱歌跳舞什么的，都很羞耻！可是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "ccc4f73ce982b240edb7dc03378d0ae1fb038339c4c0777bb94af0e7ed930824", "ja": "だから、教えてやりたいんだよ。がんばったら、\nお前でもなれるぞって。すっげー楽しいぜ！ってさ♪", "zh": "所以，我想让他知道。只要努力，就算是你也能成为偶像——我想告诉他，真的超级开心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8204319a5f9f501bfdf938d9c16d4ae22b1183573106be1c43f87a1fd5f07391", "ja": "そうか。……それは、昴の友達なのか？", "zh": "这样啊。……那是昴的朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "a4af6aa20a19a21aa8e9ca889b07cea3c5688135f0fb2aeaf32d727d78f71e0e", "ja": "え、えへへへへ……まあ、そんなトコかな？", "zh": "呃、呃嘿嘿嘿嘿……嗯，差不多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "049ea7981ec08740b5044928fb85a4b90e3c4f40030d1633342e0c50b93cecd1", "ja": "{$P$}、サンキュ！\nオレ、なんか掴めた気がするよ！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢啦！\n我感觉自己好像抓到点什么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c5ac6c13c931ec0199611073266d36ed41cf8b7f22ac47b74e71dd425719f064", "ja": "うん、ならよかった。それと……俺も、\nその子を応援したいんだけど。伝えてくれるか？", "zh": "嗯，那就好。还有……我也\n想给那孩子加加油。能帮我转达一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1022_p", "source_sha256": "35c4b728439a965652447411ad2583d7e2017a846794bcdae68f8daeaa632018", "ja": "君は、これからきっと、もっとすごいアイドルになる。\nだから、自信を持ってくれって！", "zh": "“你今后一定会成为更了不起的偶像。\n所以，要对自己有信心！”这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0264_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "d79e07e68e32322195381ead45cb930dcc03f867b1be7720a69e74005a2dec38", "ja": "{$P$}……わ、わかった！\nオレ、ちゃんと伝えるよ。絶対、忘れないからな！", "zh": "{$P$}……我、我明白了！\n我会好好传达的。绝对不会忘记！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
